    "id": "5k_training_walkers",
    "name": "5K Training: Walkers",
    "author": "Hal Higdon",
    "version": "1.0",
    "created_at": null,
    "description": "MANY, IF NOT MOST, 5K RUNNING RACES WELCOME WALKERS. Whether or not the event includes a competitive racewalking division (which requires judges), walkers usually can participate in most running races. Sometimes walkers start well before the runners, sometimes they start after the runners, sometimes they start at the same time. (Tip: Start in the back ... Continue reading \"Walkers\"",
